    runs it — no backup, archive table, or export in this repo.
  - "We stopped using it" covers code that reads the column; it doesn't cover anything outside this repo that may still
    read [38;5;153musers.notes[39m (reporting, exports, another service, support tooling). I can't verify that from here.
  - SQLite's [38;5;153mALTER TABLE ... DROP COLUMN[39m needs 3.35+; older versions require the table-rebuild dance. Worth confirming
    your deploy target.
  - [38;5;153mschema.sql[39m is kept in sync by hand, so it needs the same edit.
